        "Title": "[The Eighth Protocol] Submerged",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ROCKY_DUGONG",
        "PublicId": "134491380447",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Rocky/scene_dugong.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1312f620-bf61-4b7f-8f5c-ea4e07763a98).Image",
        "Description": "The captain&apos;s last job was transporting something important. Someone important. He doesn&apos;t know who. Doesn&apos;t matter now.\rHe shares a cage with another prisoner. A nobody. But still a witness.\rTurn the valve. Let the wet floor become the conductor. Crank the battery to maximum. Hold it longer than it takes to kill. Make sure.\rThe captain had a warning: after that delivery, the island considers any vessel hostile.\rThe submarine goes where boats can&apos;t. Under radar. Under their weaponry. Go for it.",
